    "articles": [
      {
        "locale": "zh-Hans",
        "title": "节点迁移之后，复杂度为什么可能突然过载",
        "summary": "节点会随着能力、资源与连接积累，从执行者迁移成知识、资源、协调、平台或基础设施节点；功能上升也同步扩大依赖与责任。如果复杂度增长速度超过结构吸收速度，新增节点、规则、工具与专业就会把更多能力消耗在系统自身，扩展于是从能力增长转向复杂度过载。",
        "href": "/articles/book4-article-020",
        "articleCode": "BOOK4-B4-ART-020-ZH-HANS-ARTICLE"
      },
      {
        "locale": "en",
        "title": "Why Complexity Can Overload a Runtime After Nodes Migrate",
        "summary": "As capability, resources, and connections accumulate, nodes can migrate from execution into knowledge, resource, coordination, platform, or infrastructure roles. Greater function also expands dependency and responsibility. If complexity grows faster than the structure can absorb it, new nodes, rules, tools, and specialties consume more capacity in maintaining the system itself, and expansion turns from capability growth into complexity overload.",
        "href": "/articles/book4-article-020",
        "articleCode": "BOOK4-B4-ART-020-EN-ARTICLE"
      }
